<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">
<head>
    <%- include("./partials/head.ejs") %>
    <script type="module" src="/js/page-home.js"></script>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <nav>
            <%- include("./partials/nav.ejs") %>
        </nav>

        <div class="content">
            <div class="introduction">
                <p>
                    Welcome to <b>Tracer Racers</b>, a turn-based 2D racing game! 
                </p>
                <hr>
                <p>
                    In a typical racing game, you might race around tracks in 3D and full controls. This game is a little more laid back with some maths involved!
                    Your goal is to race around tracks using <b>vectors</b>. Just how vectors have a horizontal and vertical component, your velocity also has a horizontal and vertical velocity.
                    However, you can only move at most 1 unit vertically, 1 unit horizontally, or both!
                </p>
                <p style="text-align: center; font-weight: bold;">
                    Can you keep your speed in line to be the fastest racer around?
                </p>
                <hr>
                <p>
                    You can play the game without an account. However, you'll need to sign in to save your scores and built tracks.
                </p>
                <p style="text-align: center;">
                    <button id="sign-in-google" class="btn btn-primary">
                        <i data-lucide="log-in"></i> &nbsp;
                        Sign In with Google
                    </button>
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <%- include("./partials/toast.ejs") %>

        <footer>
            <%- include("./partials/footer.ejs") %>
        </footer>
    </div>
</body>
</html>